# Platformer Jump Test
# Simulates typical platformer inputs: run and jump

# Boot and start
1500 START DOWN
1600 START UP
2500 A DOWN
2600 A UP

# Run right and jump
3500 RIGHT DOWN
4000 A DOWN
4150 A UP
4500 RIGHT UP

# Standing jump
5000 A DOWN
5200 A UP

# Run left and jump
5500 LEFT DOWN
6000 A DOWN
6150 A UP
6500 LEFT UP

# Double tap for possible dash
7000 RIGHT DOWN
7100 RIGHT UP
7150 RIGHT DOWN
7600 RIGHT UP

# Hold B while moving (run in many platformers)
8000 B DOWN
8000 RIGHT DOWN
8500 A DOWN
8650 A UP
9000 B UP
9000 RIGHT UP
